                    }
                ],
                "nameLeft": "那由他",
                "textLeft": "没有，应该说您特地腾出时间来，@我十分感激"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 100770,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-3"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "但是，父亲大人@为什么要在中庭说话呢——？"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_011.exp3.json",
                        "id": 802300,
                        "motion": 0,
                        "pos": 0,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-4"
                    }
                ],
                "nameLeft": "灯花的父亲",
                "textLeft": "现在开始，我要作为灯花的父亲，@也作为那由他的伯父说一些事情"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-5"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "在说和工作无关的事情的时候，@我想改变一下环境"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_050.exp3.json",
                        "id": 100770,
                        "motion": 200,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-6"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "哼嗯——？"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-7"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "好了，那么布置给那由他的作业，我也布置给了灯花"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-8"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "关于那个问题，@你们准备好答案了吗？"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_011.exp3.json",
                        "id": 100770,
                        "motion": 100,
                        "pos": 2,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-9"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "当然"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-10"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "是怎样的答案呢？"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_010.exp3.json",
                        "id": 100770,
                        "motion": 1,
                        "pos": 2,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-11"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "失去重要之人，@对我来说是无可奈何的事情"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_001.exp3.json",
                        "id": 100770,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-12"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "毕竟生物死去之后化为土块，@然后不断变化下去是理所当然的"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 100770,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-13"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "就算由于某种环境的变化，大量的人死去、大量的人失去他人"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_010.exp3.json",
                        "id": 100770,
                        "motion": 200,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-14"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "那也只是人类为了成为强大生物的进化的一环"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-15"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "在适应环境并进化的过程中，@死亡会和筛选一同留下大量的信息"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-16"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "因此，说它是既重要、又无可奈何的事情，真是十分完美的答案呢"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 100770,
                        "motion": 400,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-17"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "对吧？"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_001.exp3.json",
                        "id": 100770,
                        "motion": 100,
                        "pos": 2,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-18"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "而且，有关所谓灵魂这种存在@是我们无法触及的领域"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 100770,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-19"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "因为我们都是在神明的掌上起舞，@所以暂时无计可施"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 100770,
                        "motion": 1,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-20"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "所以直到看见些许曙光之前，@这也只能说是无可奈何的事情哦"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_030.exp3.json",
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-21"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "不管怎样拼尽全力，对于人的生命，我们始终是无法掌控的…"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-22"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "只要总会到来的分别还是绝对的，这都是无可奈何的，是这个意思吗"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_010.exp3.json",
                        "id": 100770,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-23"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "嗯"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-24"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "我明白了…"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_011.exp3.json",
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-25"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "那由他，你是怎么想的？"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_050.exp3.json",
                        "id": 103701,
                        "motion": 0,
                        "pos": 2,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-26"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "那由他",
                "textRight": "啊，我…"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_030.exp3.json",
                        "id": 103701,
                        "motion": 100,
                        "pos": 2,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-27"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "那由他",
                "textRight": "我最开始…@觉得是“希望”…"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 103701,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-28"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "那由他",
                "textRight": "但是，我现在简单地去想，@觉得就是既悲伤又难受的事情"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 103701,
                        "motion": 300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-29"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "那由他",
                "textRight": "就算想得很深，自己给出一份答案@这份感情也是没法被敷衍过去的"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-30"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "真的很简单呢"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 103701,
                        "motion": 1,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-31"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "那由他",
                "textRight": "对不起…"
            },
            {
                "bgm": "stop",
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_030.exp3.json",
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-32"
                    }
                ],
                "surround": "7001_birdsong",
                "textLeft": "不，让你思考这种没有答案的问题的是我"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_011.exp3.json",
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-33"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "只是思考过就很好了哦"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-34"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "就让你和母亲取得联系吧"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_050.exp3.json",
                        "id": 103701,
                        "motion": 400,
                        "pos": 2,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-35"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "那由他",
                "textRight": "真的吗？"
            },
            {
                "bgm": "bgm03_story07",
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_030.exp3.json",
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-36"
                    }
                ],
                "surround": "stop",
                "textLeft": "你已经明白了当时的自己的心情和母亲的心情了吧"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_030.exp3.json",
                        "id": 103701,
                        "motion": 0,
                        "pos": 2,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-37"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "那由他",
                "textRight": "啊…"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-38"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "虽然你的母亲是不顾头尾，@就和太助分开的任性的人物"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-39"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "即便如此，她也仍是@当时顾及亲近父亲的你抽身离去"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-40"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "如今担心着寻找父亲的你@正采取着行动的这样的人啊"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-41"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "如果与那由他相见，@但一直只被问到父亲的事情的话"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-42"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "一定会受到巨大的冲击，@也不知道会做出什么来"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 1,
                        "id": 103701,
                        "lipSynch": 0,
                        "motion": 300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-43"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "那由他",
                "textRight": "…………"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-44"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "在做了种种思考后，@或许也会有责备自己的心情"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_011.exp3.json",
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-45"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "但是毕竟那是他们两人的问题，@那由他不用自责的"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 103701,
                        "motion": 0,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-46"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "那由他",
                "textRight": "…非常感谢"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_050.exp3.json",
                        "id": 100770,
                        "live2dParam": {
                            "name": "PARAM_BRACELET",
                            "value": 1
                        },
                        "motion": 400,
                        "pos": 2,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-47"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "咦，父亲大人，@那为什么要给我布置作业呢——？"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_030.exp3.json",
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-48"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "因为灯花最近似乎做了些不太好的事情"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_030.exp3.json",
                        "id": 100770,
                        "motion": 0,
                        "pos": 2,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-49"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "才没有那种事呢——"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-50"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "但是，我从你身上感觉到了像是身处什么的中心的气息哦"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 100770,
                        "motion": 100,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-51"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "是、是这样喵——…？"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-52"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "请你至少要听取我的这些建议"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 100770,
                        "motion": 1,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-53"
                    }
                ],
                "nameRight": "灯花",
                "textRight": "什么…？"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "cheek": 0,
                        "face": "mtn_ex_011.exp3.json",
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-54"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "灯花注视的地方太高了"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-55"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "就算弯腰也还是太高了@坐下来倒是正好"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-56"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "大家的视野中容纳不了整个城市@能看见的只是几栋房屋罢了"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-57"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "也无法以全人类的规模思考@只能以自己周围和个体的规模思考"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
                    {
                        "id": 802300,
                        "voiceFullAuto": "fullvoice/section_102505/vo_full_102505-8-58"
                    }
                ],
                "textLeft": "不要忘记这些…"
            },
            {
                "chara": [
